# Citation

If you want to cite this project in academic or technical writing, please
use the following metadata:

```bibtex
@software{hermes_antigravity_acp,
  title = {Hermes Antigravity ACP Adapter},
  author = {Polishchuk, Taras},
  year = {2026},
  version = {2.1.0},
  url = {https://github.com/taras-polishchuk/hermes-antigravity-acp},
  license = {MIT}
}
```

The adapter is a thin, local compatibility layer. It depends on:

- Google Antigravity CLI (`agy`): https://antigravity.google
- Hermes Agent: https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com
- Antigravity OAuth protocol: https://antigravity.google/docs/cli/reference
